      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Total hectares to be reforested has been reduced from 1,300 to 700 hectares with correspondent implications in the volume of ERsthat will be reduced to 37,880 tons until 2017. ERPA has been amended to reflect this change.</narrative>
